  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Pacific Partnerships Platform AusP3 - Smaller Pacific Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Pacific Partnerships Platform (AusP3) is an enabling and development platform for Australia&#x2019;s investments in smaller Pacific countries, with a particular focus on supporting Australia&#x2019;s governance programs in Kiribati, Nauru and Tuvalu. AusP3 will contribute to a broad range of bilateral development priorities, mutually agreed in partnership between Australia and each relevant partner government.</narrative>
  </description>
